  <name>ARC CAD</name>
  <summary>Professional 3D CAD software for parametric modeling</summary>
  <description>
    <p>ARC CAD is a modern, open-source 3D CAD application built with Rust and Tauri.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Parametric 3D modeling</li>
      <li>STEP/IGES import/export</li>
      <li>Assembly constraints</li>
      <li>Technical drawing generation</li>
      <li>Plugin system (Lua/WASM)</li>
      <li>Modern WebGPU-based renderer</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
